 is the slang term for removing body hair from men?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Manscaping blends \u201cman\u201d with \u201clandscaping\u201d to describe styling or removing men\u2019s body hair.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-372e-70a3-8ecb-18013c5b8c9c","description":"Manscaping","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7083-b2a7-b7266b35a2d9","description":"Bodyculture","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7597-b9f2-ff07d73a3e84","description":"Topihairy","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-79c3-9c2f-aa7825b1db77","description":"Guydening","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7e67-9a94-37188423ed51","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What is the name of the bandaged walking dead often seen during Halloween, whose name comes from the Persian word for \'wax\'?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A mummy is a preserved body; ancient Egyptian embalmers used natron to dry bodies before wrapping them in linen.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7438-b922-46d7aa92e150","description":"A mummy","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7ac1-be8c-4fa4ac5c5ecd","description":"A zombie","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7dc0-974e-b4aa1b783353","description":"A skeleton","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7b31-82c1-5b6dc596ec26","description":"A vampire","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7323-8816-660e8f664021","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What did \'my true love give to me\' on the first day of Christmas?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A Partridge in a Pear Tree is the gift in the carol\u2019s opening verse. Each succeeding verse adds gifts while repeating those already named.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7416-9f03-2c5cc8a67640","description":"A Partridge In A Pear Tree","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7ea1-8c0c-881da62d177d","description":"5 Gold Rings","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9