difficulty":1,"explanation":"A bank often earns income by charging borrowers interest and may pay interest on customers\u2019 savings.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-372e-74cf-a45d-6bc55b7c45f6","description":"Bank","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7186-b7d6-e063338c368c","description":"Book store","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7aaf-a816-09ee93d5af97","description":"Joint venture","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-76af-85c2-acc0b44dafaa","description":"Pulp mill","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7157-8615-dff918fcc971","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What is the English title of the Christmas carol written by the Austrian Josef Mohr, originally called \'Stille Nacht\'?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Silent Night was first performed in 1818; Josef Mohr wrote the lyrics, and Franz Xaver Gruber composed the music.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7f42-9a25-213cc6d452f8","description":"Silent Night","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-76b1-9a36-6d6716b18d68","description":"The Holly and the Ivy","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-747b-acb8-92290e30dce6","description":"Oh, Holy Night","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7823-a371-f4d00428e9e4","description":"We Three Kings","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7a88-b397-324a5b48b394","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which toy is a multi-colored block you have to reorganize?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Rubik\'s Cube was created by Hungarian architect Ern\u0151 Rubik and was first called the Magic Cube.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7a11-8487-15decfe0dfef","description":"Rubik\'s Cube","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-70b1-9124-2afcc467a63f","description":"Furby","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7e85-a4e5-2cb26533f2ab","description":"Playmobil","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7390-8820-91adb5