 Roberts","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7919-b8d7-ce91f59fa286","description":"Patricia Anne Reynolds","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-740e-953c-9d13fb917372","description":"Margaret Louise Turner","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-75f7-a90e-d83161ca7b6a","description":"Dorothy Jane Crawford","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-71e0-9c04-ddd92375a5fc","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which marketing slogan would you associate with Gillette?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Gillette introduced \u201cThe Best a Man Can Get\u201d in 1989, and the tagline became closely associated with its advertising.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-372e-72a1-b243-82931e2a2276","description":"The Best a Man Can Get","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7f38-99b4-762039e74492","description":"Quality never goes out of style","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7719-b967-39213584fef0","description":"Easy, breezy, beautiful\u2026.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7abe-919d-706c2e2c1e79","description":"Maybe she\'s born with it","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7c80-bc7e-3a92eb60385f","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which former US president\'s wife is called Michelle?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Barack Obama was the first Black president of the United States, and Michelle Obama served as first lady during his two terms.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7556-a3f4-134023f7bc6e","description":"Barack Obama","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-79f6-a933-3286151d204d","description":"Bill Clinton","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7750-bc9b-9e0cf4070e62","description":"George Bush","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-7306-96a0-7f1d47635cbd","description":"Donald Trump","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-372e-76dc-a79e-a83241d4b369","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b48